{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Korean Translators : Haram Eom , Jihyeon Kim</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/SIMPLIFIED_CHESS.png?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hellmate is a roguelike deck-building game inspired by chess, where you focus on creating powerful synergies with cards to kill the opposing king piece as quickly as possible</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to play pieces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend your mana as efficiently as possible.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/Steam-gif-cardplayin.gif?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill enemy pieces to remove any threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/Steam-gif-Attackpiecev2.gif?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Damage points only affect the king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill the enemy king in the shortest round time and move forward.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/Steam-gif-Damagev2.gif?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for the king patterns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your strategy around your enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/Steam-gif-Pattern.gif?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/BUILD_YOUR_DECK.png?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your deck with <strong>unique</strong> Spell and Piece cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/Steam-gif-PieceSpellDeck.gif?t=1749912357\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every <strong>Consumable and Joker card</strong> you pick can significantly impact your game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/JokerConsCards.png?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/CHOOSE_YOUR_PATH.png?t=1749912357\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique roguelike chess experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run has 7 randomly generated floors, each themed after one of the 7 deadly sins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/extras/Steam-gif-map.gif?t=1749912357\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3225700?t=1749912357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/ddf955b66736f6f2bec95acb4f8a36ef0c2e1064/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749912357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225700/967a6611072fd531485da4b25a8